t hearing context\n\nThe claim itself is an escape of water claim (notified 5 May 2026) where the adjuster's report, drying works and restoration invoice have all been processed. Handler A. Wrenfield is managing it.", "response_hash": "sha256:f106d67a290f1331198d2f4450e90c95ff37209ec59d62b5ad397d005b8e7efd", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
